   "Id": "m0153:0x06003322",
   "ProposedName": "ReceiveHidReportsAsync",
   "Reason": "Reads while the HID device is open/readable, validates reports, assembles sequential fragments, and enqueues an inbound USB message on the end flag. Sequence failure suppresses delivery; cancellation exits quietly; read failure queues UsbReadFailedMessage. It does not add a received-byte-count check.",
   "Source": [
