   "Id": "m0153:0x0600331F",
   "ProposedName": "RestartCommunicationAsync",
   "Reason": "Guards against overlapping restart, stops the reconnect timer, closes as broken, delays 100 ms and starts communication again. Rearms reconnect on error and clears the guard in finally. Only 6.4 additionally invokes Reconnected subscribers after startup.",
